{"id": "0200", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "我已將你的名指示他們，還要指示他們，使你所愛我的愛在他們裏面，我也在他們裏面。」", "target": [43, 17, 26], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 7.6585, "sha256": "424a1e079b7762618fc5b88f6f03569ed749f15dd5cd84631b377b807cee2c8e", "transcript": "I have already named your name, and you have to name them, so that you can love me in them, and I am in them too.", "decode_s": 0.7692431670147926, "cpu_s": 0.16775699999999993, "rtf": 0.10044305895603481, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 84, "units": 35, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0205", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "耶穌說：「狐狸有洞，天空的飛鳥有窩，只是人子沒有枕頭的地方。」", "target": [42, 9, 58], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.9879375, "sha256": "ac50e6bee5207129e498a63d97b4b2955b209be9f3546b948a4f18c399308f43", "transcript": "Jesus said, \"Hurray! There is a hole in heaven, but there is a hole in the earth.\"", "decode_s": 0.7070005000568926, "cpu_s": 0.14538200000000012, "rtf": 0.11807078815650508, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 60, "units": 25, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0210", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "並使他的兒子經火，又觀兆，用法術，立交鬼的和行巫術的，多行耶和華眼中看爲惡的事，惹動他的怒氣；", "target": [12, 21, 6], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 11.6820625, "sha256": "185eba70c75be61592970fd9a7951f4cdde6d961c3758e1e771ac78f2767cd64", "transcript": "(speaking in foreign language)", "decode_s": 0.48341295903082937, "cpu_s": 0.07869100000000007, "rtf": 0.04138078862622327, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 41, "units": 41, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0215", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "我們出錢才得水喝； 我們的柴是人賣給我們的。", "target": [25, 5, 4], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 3.7561875, "sha256": "d6d581a24a30285d7e618d4214660a87ea387e67cac5e7a16cf67d60df025fe3", "transcript": "(speaking in foreign language)", "decode_s": 0.5746446249540895, "cpu_s": 0.05257800000000046, "rtf": 0.15298613952420895, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 25, "units": 19, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0220", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "不可露你兒婦的下體；她是你兒子的妻，不可露她的下體。", "target": [3, 18, 15], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.3570625, "sha256": "6c5c3d6b34682f9a1957506a739062d4b1ddca8feb8654a1d6d3c1dc8dde7ae8", "transcript": "He is your son's wife, you can't be his servant.", "decode_s": 1.2579534590477124, "cpu_s": 0.08710200000000068, "rtf": 0.23482150134475982, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 35, "units": 23, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0225", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "說：「以掃若來擊殺這一隊，剩下的那一隊還可以逃避。」", "target": [1, 32, 8], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.8491875, "sha256": "dd8b36777f59b916bea82159fcf9101aaee55236caefc5cb874cdf2f8006dbf1", "transcript": "\"If you come to kill this team, the rest of the team can still escape.\"", "decode_s": 0.8205754159716889, "cpu_s": 0.10113799999999973, "rtf": 0.14028878642917308, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 53, "units": 21, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0230", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "麥西生路低人、亞拿米人、利哈比人、拿弗土希人、", "target": [1, 10, 13], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.187875, "sha256": "fac345f1232a649e07e1ed0e1b81aadda177d7c74c0c9c782d567fc53608eb7b", "transcript": "Maitseh is a low-income, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor, poor,", "decode_s": 6.275485000107437, "cpu_s": 0.771808, "rtf": 1.209644604025239, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 439, "units": 19, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0235", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "一月之內，我除滅三個牧人，因爲我的心厭煩他們；他們的心也憎嫌我。", "target": [38, 11, 8], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 6.277, "sha256": "58b1431c312ed2ba3ed562dc447e2781db217ec01002ce70e9f19bbe208318d7", "transcript": "(speaking in foreign language)", "decode_s": 0.4819884580792859, "cpu_s": 0.0986659999999997, "rtf": 0.07678643588964248, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 28, "units": 28, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0240", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "七月二十三日，王遣散衆民；他們因見耶和華向大衛和所羅門與他民以色列所施的恩惠，就都心中喜樂，各歸各家去了。", "target": [14, 7, 10], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 13.3354375, "sha256": "e26bec90520c9bd6aa84b66b1223db41036e4b29b0be4e557317794c6835606d", "transcript": "July 23, \"The Three Sons of the King\" They should meet with the great Han Suo Luo Men and their famous poem \"The Enchanted\" in the heart, and go back to their homes.", "decode_s": 1.6247188749257475, "cpu_s": 0.22725099999999987, "rtf": 0.12183468858263913, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 120, "units": 47, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0245", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "惟恐多說，你嫌煩絮，只求你寬容聽我們說幾句話。", "target": [44, 24, 4], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.8430625, "sha256": "00ef4e9f454443ba713334f6b9e4d9a103b4fd4941c7766ec1fd80094eaf1b45", "transcript": "(speaking in foreign language)", "decode_s": 0.6993603340815753, "cpu_s": 0.06354400000000027, "rtf": 0.1444045651035012, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 25, "units": 20, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0250", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "所羅門在耶路撒冷作以色列衆人的王共四十年。", "target": [11, 11, 42], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.77875, "sha256": "d74109bdae85bf1ffaa5fc992e79800ef803e43b773470941f7a8a9e75e0905e", "transcript": "Sororamn in Jerusalem was the king of the people of Israel for 40 years.", "decode_s": 0.755659457994625, "cpu_s": 0.09889299999999945, "rtf": 0.15812910447180226, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 56, "units": 20, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0255", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "主－我們的 神是憐憫饒恕人的，我們卻違背了他，", "target": [27, 9, 9], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.662875, "sha256": "b0fc20dbfb23b132ccaa91ac7984e79b15f3729b3ad2f0f570fbbf9fc15bdf3f", "transcript": "We are the gods, the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people of the people", "decode_s": 4.937294750008732, "cpu_s": 0.7516799999999995, "rtf": 1.0588520494348943, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 802, "units": 19, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0260", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "從那日起，我的僕人一半做工，一半拿槍、拿盾牌、拿弓、穿 鎧甲，官長都站在猶大衆人的後邊。", "target": [16, 4, 16], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 9.3191875, "sha256": "83b250bbda44fc0b81eb0c1eca1227460bc1c705a3dc4e45a2a1e45c7d17aad6", "transcript": "From that day onward, my servants worked half of the day, half of the day, holding guns, holding a shield, holding a bow, wearing a armor, and all the officials were standing behind the crowd.", "decode_s": 2.4275220829294994, "cpu_s": 0.2628849999999998, "rtf": 0.2604864515205322, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 150, "units": 36, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0265", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "埃及中，無論是頭與尾， 棕枝與蘆葦，所做之工都不成就。", "target": [23, 19, 15], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.4676875, "sha256": "35b50527bede503d5e471d0703dcb15a95ed4d8974022841aec304b637ef7d86", "transcript": "(speaking in foreign language)", "decode_s": 0.3447477089939639, "cpu_s": 0.05367799999999967, "rtf": 0.06305183114323265, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 25, "units": 22, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0270", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "願憐恤、平安、慈愛多多地加給你們。", "target": [65, 1, 2], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.3475, "sha256": "a33bf219e5380b0db08f50eb101f6f6f7bf81195133ec96b7aaddfe9c41d6f76", "transcript": "(speaking in foreign language)", "decode_s": 0.48668187495786697, "cpu_s": 0.04919099999999954, "rtf": 0.11194522713234432, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 25, "units": 14, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0275", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "你們不要自欺；濫交是敗壞善行。", "target": [46, 15, 33], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 2.889, "sha256": "8cb0ae1b49a7f7f3f048c169debb18155cfd4a5e9026bdd92fbc7aca36dd3795", "transcript": "(speaking in foreign language)", "decode_s": 1.3254783330485225, "cpu_s": 0.047728000000000215, "rtf": 0.4588017767561518, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 25, "units": 13, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0280", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "並且因爲他是人子，就賜給他行審判的權柄。", "target": [43, 5, 26], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.649375, "sha256": "eef60d763cc19b9b22428a36c5403745a26382eb0756534482552fadf7d682fe", "transcript": "and because he is a human being, he gave him the full amount of money to be investigated.", "decode_s": 0.9664676249958575, "cpu_s": 0.11515499999999967, "rtf": 0.20787043957432075, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 70, "units": 18, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0285", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "那獻供物的就要將細面伊法十分之一，並油一欣四分之一，調和作素祭，獻給耶和華。", "target": [4, 15, 4], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 8.774375, "sha256": "547dbd6a18ccf53b7598322e95b8b32b45fa6b0ffe669274de85ffe7dc0f24dc", "transcript": "(speaking in foreign language)", "decode_s": 0.8730930000310764, "cpu_s": 0.06234899999999932, "rtf": 0.09950486502241772, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 35, "units": 35, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0290", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "說假預言的先知，就是預言本心詭詐的先知，他們這樣存心要到幾時呢？ 他們各人將所做的夢對鄰舍述說，想要使我的百姓忘記我的名，正如他們列祖因巴力忘記我的名一樣。", "target": [24, 23, 26], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": true, "duration_s": 15.1954375, "sha256": "0f34e7a970e48f75cdbfe2b722548b91e0cd9e80afd278c12da95b23feb762b2", "transcript": "\"The fairy tale of the false prophecy, the fairy tale of the prophecy of the devil, how long will they be like this?\" \"The dream they will make of the spirit of the spirit is to make my people forget my name, just like the name of the group of Yngbali.\"", "decode_s": 2.123888500034809, "cpu_s": 0.27607300000000023, "rtf": 0.13977146100826707, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 194, "units": 73, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0295", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "我們要爲你編上金辮，鑲上銀釘。 〔新娘〕 王正坐席的時候， 我的哪噠香膏發出香味。", "target": [22, 1, 11], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": true, "duration_s": 7.5255625, "sha256": "b66706466c716444a2b8456c6eea8cb9e669531ac1e484ae6c86ce588a64ffd2", "transcript": "(speaking in foreign language)", "decode_s": 0.7951262498972937, "cpu_s": 0.07456800000000019, "rtf": 0.10565671999897598, "max_rss_bytes": 508641280, "edits": 32, "units": 32, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
